<title>INDIA: Delhi shares close marginally down in mixed trade.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares close marginally down in mixed trade.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share prices on the Delhi Stock Exchange closed virtually unchanged in mixed trade as profit selling by speculators squared off gains made on buying by financial institutions, brokers said.</p>
<p>The bourse's benchmark index closed 0.08 points lower at 701.05.</p>
</text>
